invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: TRANSPORT_NAMED stops naming ch_ticket_obfuscated_age, so PUBLIC
  lists the name ticket.h declares while the object defines the name the
  header maps it to, ch_ticket_obfuscated_age_tcp_nonblocking. nmedit
  refuses to package the object on macOS, and objcopy localizes the call
  elsewhere, so lib-check's export list differs from PUBLIC either way.
  An image of two transports needs each object's call under its own name
  (docs/decisions.md 61 and 72).

--- old
TRANSPORT_NAMED := ch_build ch_srv_check ch_pubkey_from_pem ch_ticket_obfuscated_age
--- new
TRANSPORT_NAMED := ch_build ch_srv_check ch_pubkey_from_pem
